{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has ended, but the road never stops. In this high-speed vehicular roguelike, you\u2019ll drive, fight, and upgrade your way through an undead-infested wasteland. Armed with front-mounted guns and whatever scrap you can salvage, you must push forward through procedurally generated rural roads, highways, and crumbling cities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive, Shoot, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're behind the wheel of humanity\u2019s last hope: a heavily armed, upgradable death machine. Keep your speed high and your reflexes sharp as you blast through zombie hordes and giant deadly bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/4ea76a839c97a1be6dd99782511c2910.poster.avif?t=1766123444\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/4ea76a839c97a1be6dd99782511c2910.webm?t=1766123444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/4ea76a839c97a1be6dd99782511c2910.mp4?t=1766123444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ultimate Ride</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car is your tank, and keeping it in top shape is the key. Choose from a collection of over 40 cards, ranging from consumables to weapon and vehicle upgrades. Permanently progress by upgrading the cards and come back stronger.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/579f9060870693e140a7d73cbe2be881.poster.avif?t=1766123444\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/579f9060870693e140a7d73cbe2be881.webm?t=1766123444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/579f9060870693e140a7d73cbe2be881.mp4?t=1766123444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Roads, Endless Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same. Every highway, backroad, and ruined city is procedurally generated, offering new layouts, enemy encounters, biomes, weather and challenges with each playthrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/85c9b92cfe14455f02734f245d01bfb2.poster.avif?t=1766123444\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/85c9b92cfe14455f02734f245d01bfb2.webm?t=1766123444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/85c9b92cfe14455f02734f245d01bfb2.mp4?t=1766123444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1913310?t=1766123444","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/da12e6c8f896eea32d51ee6b9220e6ba03a0a3ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766123444","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/464a7434e16be66ed627b35c54e105be2e79b667/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766123444","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/464a7434e16be66ed627b35c54e105be2e79b667/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766123444","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4064400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has ended, but the road never stops. In this high-speed vehicular roguelike, you\u2019ll drive, fight, and upgrade your way through an undead-infested wasteland. Armed with front-mounted guns and whatever scrap you can salvage, you must push forward through procedurally generated rural roads, highways, and crumbling cities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive, Shoot, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're behind the wheel of humanity\u2019s last hope: a heavily armed, upgradable death machine. Keep your speed high and your reflexes sharp as you blast through zombie hordes and giant deadly bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/4ea76a839c97a1be6dd99782511c2910.poster.avif?t=1766123444\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/4ea76a839c97a1be6dd99782511c2910.webm?t=1766123444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/4ea76a839c97a1be6dd99782511c2910.mp4?t=1766123444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ultimate Ride</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car is your tank, and keeping it in top shape is the key. Choose from a collection of over 40 cards, ranging from consumables to weapon and vehicle upgrades. Permanently progress by upgrading the cards and come back stronger.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a